  "articleBody": "A successful laundry room remodel starts with a measured layout, a clear appliance plan, and early review of plumbing, electrical, ventilation, storage, and flooring needs. In San Diego County, the scope can also affect permits, especially when the project relocates plumbing, adds circuits, changes ventilation, or alters walls. A design-build team can coordinate these decisions before construction begins.",
